cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Greedy Set Cover Field Selection for Multi-object Spectroscopy in C++ MPI"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Travis
    family-names: Stenborg
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2693-9628"
url: "https://github.com/tstenborg/mpi-greedy-set-cover"
abstract: >-
   "This repository contains code and supporting material associated with the \
   article 'Greedy Set Cover Field Selection for Multi-object Spectroscopy in \
   C++ MPI'. The article explored the problem of efficiently observing large \
   populations of astronomical targets that cannot be covered by a single \
   telescope pointing. Using a greedy set-cover approach, the software \
   repeatedly selects the field of view that captures the greatest number of \
   previously unobserved targets, maximising the scientific return obtainable \
   from a limited number of telescope pointings."
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - "greedy-algorithms"
  - mpi
